# Local backend base URL used by the shared @aistudy/api-client.
# Default matches the Spring Boot dev server (ADR-029 / ADR-030).
#
# Contract (FE-001.5 PRE-COMMIT REVIEW FIX-01):
#   - ONLY http:/https: URLs are accepted. Invalid/missing values fall
#     back to http://localhost:8080 (never a wildcard origin).
#   - The main-process CSP derives connect-src from the SAME value
#     (src/shared/api-config.ts), using scheme+host+port only — a path
#     like /api is kept for the API client but never enters the CSP.
#   - Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9090/api
#     -> CSP connect-src ... http://127.0.0.1:9090
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
